:: StoryTitle
Yharnam – Kapitel 1

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "6C1F9E52-3B8A-4E0B-9D1A-7A51C0B1D9E3",
  "format": "Harlowe",
  "format-version": "3.3.8",
